{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36620","headline":"湘南春日怀古 · 罗隐","name":"湘南春日怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴江春暖兰蕙薰，凫鷖苒苒鸥着羣。\n洛阳贾谊自无命，少陵杜甫兼有文。\n空阔远帆遮落日，苍茫野树碍归云。\n松醪酒好昭潭静，闲过中流一吊君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}